flowchart LR
  Browser[User Browser]
  subgraph Frontend
    NextApp[Next.js App (apps/web)]
    NextAPI[Next.js Serverless API (/app/api/*)]
    UI[React Components & Pages]
  end

  subgraph Backend
    ExpressAPI[Express API (apps/api) /api/v1/*]
    AIService[AI modules: ai.service, chat.service]
    EmailService[Email analytics & classifier]
    Redis[Redis Cache]
    PrismaClient[Prisma Client (@atomberg/database)]
  end

  DB[(Postgres DB)]
  Ollama[Ollama LLM (local)]
  Gemini[Google Gemini API]
  ExternalMail[Mail Providers (Gmail/Outlook)]
  Vercel[Vercel Hosting]

  Browser --> UI
  UI -->|calls| NextAPI
  NextAPI -->|proxy / orchestrates| ExpressAPI
  UI -->|direct| ExpressAPI
  ExpressAPI --> PrismaClient
  PrismaClient --> DB
  ExpressAPI --> Redis
  ExpressAPI --> AIService
  AIService -->|local| Ollama
  AIService -->|cloud| Gemini
  ExpressAPI --> EmailService
  EmailService --> ExternalMail
  Vercel --> NextApp
  Vercel --> NextAPI
